    "displayName": "Orison Relief: Stop Nine Tails Regrouping",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Just got word that some of the Nine Tails involved in the recent assault on Orison are convening near [Location] before launching their next attack. We need a capable fighter pilot to head them off and take care of them before they start wreaking havoc again.\n\nTo complicate matters, from what we know there’s a very high chance that they might have additional reinforcements inbound, so be sure the extra ships don’t take you by surprise.\n\nAll the best,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
